  "description": "Libelle Ibella, a viscount's daughter, works undercover as a reporter to repay her father's gambling debt. ⁤⁤While covering a story, she accidentally discovers her fiancé's love affair. Devastated and heartbroken, she drunkenly proposes to Systain von Diranta, a stranger at a bar. ⁤⁤To her surprise, she wakes up with a marriage approval letter signed by the grand duke himself. ⁤⁤Overnight, Libelle finds herself thrust into the role of grand duchess, struggling to balance her new duties with her secret life as a reporter. ⁤⁤And little does Systain know that she's the reporter behind a scandalous article questioning his manhood... \n\n(Source: Tappytoon)",
